  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_0416.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>39 fotos del fin del a&ntilde;o 2014 y bienvenida al 2015 en Onda, con escasa asistencia en la Puerta del Sol, fiesta en algunas pe&ntilde;as, como la Abejorros, y remate en la carpa instalada por el Ayuntamiento en el aparcamiento del Recinto Multisusos, donde el Consell de Festes hab&iacute;a organizado la verbena con la orquesta La L&iacute;nea.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdanyonda1415/img_0301.jpg\" alt=\"img_0301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdanyonda1415/img_0303.jpg\" alt=\"img_0303\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdanyonda1415/img_0305.jpg\" alt=\"img_0305\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdanyonda1415/img_0308.jpg\" alt=\"img_0308\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdanyonda1415/img_0309.jpg\" alt=\"img_0309\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdanyonda1415/img_0315.jpg\" alt=\"img_0315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdanyonda1415/img_0319.jpg\" alt=\"img_0319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdanyonda1415/img_0322.jpg\" alt=\"img_0322\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/capdanyonda1415/img_0325.jpg\" alt=\"img_0325\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4